WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Brand and recognition. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Compare repeatable visual cues

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Recognition comes from repeated visual cues, but a single photo or badge does not prove an entire brand story. Compare evidence across examples.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: List three observable repeated features, then label which are measured and which are your interpretation.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Blind silhouette challenge

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: A view supports interpretation; it cannot prove hidden structure or compliance alone.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Compare repeatable visual cues
